{"schema_version": 2, "unit_id": "tag:04PW:statement", "parent_tag": "04PV", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme. The rule which associates to a closed subscheme\nof <MATH_0002> its underlying closed subset defines a bijection\n<MATHSEG_0001>closed subschemes <MATHSEG_0002>such that <MATHSEG_0003> is flat<MATHSEG_0004>closed subsets <MATHSEG_0005>closed under generalizations<MATHSEG_0006>\nIf <MATH_0003> is such a closed subscheme, every morphism of schemes\n<MATH_0004> with <MATH_0005> set theoretically factors (scheme\ntheoretically) through <MATH_0006>.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$X$", "MATHSEG_0001": "$$\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{matrix}\n\\text{", "MATHSEG_0002": "}Z \\subset X \\\\\n\\text{", "MATHSEG_0003": "}Z \\to X\\text{", "MATHSEG_0004": "}\n\\end{matrix}\n\\right\\}\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{matrix}\n\\text{", "MATHSEG_0005": "}Z \\subset X \\\\\n\\text{", "MATHSEG_0006": "}\n\\end{matrix}\n\\right\\}\n$$", "MATH_0003": "$Z \\subset X$", "MATH_0004": "$g : Y \\to X$", "MATH_0005": "$g(Y) \\subset Z$", "MATH_0006": "$Z$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-characterize-flat-closed-immersions}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "math_text_regions": [{"region_id": "math/0001", "delimiter_kind": "display-dollar", "source": "$$\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{matrix}\n\\text{closed subschemes }Z \\subset X \\\\\n\\text{such that }Z \\to X\\text{ is flat}\n\\end{matrix}\n\\right\\}\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{matrix}\n\\text{closed subsets }Z \\subset X \\\\\n\\text{closed under generalizations}\n\\end{matrix}\n\\right\\}\n$$", "source_hash": "sha256:cfef64c7cf9068df1576ce179ebb48cb64047b2f7161beaad33f62392634bc9d", "source_byte_span": {"start": 189, "end": 453}, "pieces": [{"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0001"}, {"kind": "text", "slot_id": "m